# ============================================================
#  The cast. Each NPC has a relationship record:
#    rel  (-100..100)  how they feel about you
#    love (0..100)     romantic interest (romance: true only)
#    bond             none | friend | close | rival | nemesis | partner | ex
#  Characters are introduced with `meet <id>` (or any rel/love/bond change).
# ============================================================

@npc lyra
name: Lyra Vaneshade
title: Heir of House Vaneshade, pyromancy prodigy
pronouns: she/her
house: Emberhall
color: #b0383c
romance: true
look: hair:7 skin:5 style:1
tags: noble ambitious fire
desc: Brilliant, impatient and used to winning. She treats everyone as either a rival or furniture — and is quietly lonely about it.

@npc tobias
name: Tobias Fennick
title: Farmer's son on a turnip scholarship
pronouns: he/him
house: Rootward
color: #4f8a3c
romance: true
look: hair:2 skin:0 style:2
tags: commoner kind herbs
desc: Big hands, bigger heart. Talks to plants and, worryingly, the plants seem to answer.

@npc seraphine
name: Seraphine Hale
title: Seer who never quite looks at the present
pronouns: she/her
house: Stillwater
color: #6a4aa8
romance: true
look: hair:4 skin:3 style:4
tags: seer quiet mystery
desc: Speaks in half-sentences, as if finishing the other half in a different week. Often right. Unsettlingly often.

@npc corvin
name: Corvin Ashby
title: Charming liability
pronouns: he/him
house: Duskgate
color: #3a3a4a
romance: true
look: hair:0 skin:1 style:3
tags: rogue guile trouble
desc: Knows every locked door in the academy and has opinions about all of them. Owes money to at least three people.

@npc mira
name: Mira Ten
title: Artificer of questionable inventions
pronouns: they/them
house: Brasswick
color: #2a8a8a
romance: true
look: hair:5 skin:2 style:0
tags: artificer chaotic
desc: Smells permanently of solder and ozone. Has built a clockwork owl, a self-stirring cauldron and at least one small fire.

@npc kael
name: Kael Dumont
title: Transfer student from the frozen North
pronouns: he/him
house: Stillwater
color: #3a5a7a
romance: true
look: hair:4 skin:0 style:0
tags: mystery north hollowstar
desc: Arrived mid-term with no luggage and frost in his eyelashes. Doesn't talk about where he came from. Watches the sky at night.

@npc nessa
name: Nessa Quill
title: Editor of the Lumen Ledger
pronouns: she/her
house: Duskgate
color: #a86a2a
romance: true
look: hair:2 skin:4 style:3
tags: gossip journalist
desc: Runs the student paper with a quill that writes on its own. Everyone is a story; some are just not finished yet.

@npc bram
name: Bram Hollis
title: Prefect, enforcer, menace
pronouns: he/him
house: Emberhall
color: #7a4a20
romance: false
start_rel: -10
look: hair:3 skin:1 style:2
tags: prefect bully rival
desc: Upper-year prefect with a ledger of demerits and a fondness for writing your name in it.

@npc thorne
name: Professor Aldric Thorne
short: Professor Thorne
title: Master of Arcana
pronouns: he/him
house: Faculty
color: #444466
romance: false
look: hair:4 skin:0 style:0
tags: faculty mentor strict
desc: Severe, exacting, allergic to flattery. Rumoured to have once out-dueled a storm.

@npc maud
name: Old Maud
short: Old Maud
title: Groundskeeper and hedge-witch
pronouns: she/her
house: Faculty
color: #6a7a3a
romance: false
look: hair:4 skin:2 style:4
tags: faculty kind herbs
desc: Keeps bees, chickens and a rather large secret garden. Gives advice you only understand two weeks later.

@npc isolde
name: Headmistress Isolde Marrow
short: Headmistress Marrow
title: Headmistress of Lumenhold
pronouns: she/her
house: Faculty
color: #5a2a4a
romance: false
look: hair:7 skin:5 style:1
tags: faculty authority
desc: Tall, pale and impossibly calm. She remembers every student's name — and every student's mistakes.

@npc ilse
name: Ilse Dumont
title: Kael's younger sister, a storm in white furs
pronouns: she/her
house: none
color: #8aa8c8
romance: false
look: hair:4 skin:5 style:1
tags: north hollowstar
desc: Raised by the Hollow cult to open a door she has never seen. Sharp as an icicle, lonely as a frozen lake, and much younger than she pretends to be.
